@echo off
A:\SAY /X
A:\SAY This is the accessible D O S talking disk.
A:\SAY SBTALK is the software synthesizer, Provox is the screen reader.
A:\SAY Provox keys: the slash key is the prefix. Slash then a letter gives review commands.
A:\SAY Say followed by words speaks them. Say slash X stops speech.
A:\SAY Say slash F and a file name reads a file.
A:\SAY E S P K followed by words speaks them with the best voice on the Sound Blaster.
A:\SAY E S P K dash K followed by words speaks them with that voice on the P C speaker.
A:\SAY Edit followed by a file name opens the FreeDOS editor. Mem shows memory. Dir lists files.
A:\SAY To use another Sound Blaster address, edit A colon backslash blaster.bat.
A:\SAY Type reset voi to choose another voice at the next boot.
